  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498004508), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/52255469), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/rjadms_), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/jt_sr_0078), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4998261)\n\n[How a girl saves herself in the world]\n\nThe earth collapsed and the 'land' disappeared, but unfortunately, humanity was not extinct.  \nThis is because the military company \"North\" created a so-called \"ark\" and burned people-accurate labor forces- to endure a series of disasters.  \nThe surviving people were exploited by labor to suit North's taste, and lived a rough life in it.  \nA life in which dozens of people are raped and killed in a lump of bread and hundreds of people lay down in one room...  \nThe place where the ark reached was hell, not paradise.\n\nKim is a 15-year-old girl born in Ark and living in Ark.  \nMom dies, and she doesn't know who she is. What Kim was given is an old photo, an off electronic watch, and a 'special ability'.\n\nLike his mother, who was a diver, one day when Kim was making a living as a diver, suddenly,  \nThere is an opportunity to save the fate of Arkju and his future.",
